The game balance is tweaked to allow players with all sorts of
restrictions to do all sorts of interesting things.  Atheists can still
find ways to BUC-ID things.

Let me put it this way: Kickboxing would not make or break a game for me.
But it would allow me to easily identify which gems are valuable beyond
just the hard ones, without losing them (by throwing them to unicorns).
